rows.abstract:
Proposes to amend Sec.77 of PD 705 wherein a specific set of penalties independent of that imposed under Revised Penal Code Art. 309 (Theft) and Art.310 (Qualified Theft) - will be imposed to the following illegal activities:
Sec. 77 - Cutting, Gathering, and/or Collecting Timber or Other Forest Products Without License;
Sec. 78 - Unlawful Occupation or Destruction of Forest Lands and Grazing Lands;
Sec. 80 - Illegal Occupation of National Parks System and Recreation Areas and Vandalism Therein;
Sec. 81 - Destruction of Wildlife Resources 
Sec. 83 - Misclassification and Survey by Government Official or Employee;
Sec. 85 - Coercion and Influence
Sec. 86 - Unlawful Possession of Implements and Devices Used by Forest Officers;
Sec. 87 - Payment, Collection, and Remittance of Forest Charges;
Sec. 88 - Sale of Wood Products.
